{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-11-1","title":"Revelation 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The two witnesses prophesy. 6 They have power to shut heaven, that it rain not. 7 The beast shall fight against them, and kill them. 8 They lie unburied; 11 and after three and a half days rise again. 14 The second woe is past. 15 The seventh trumpet sounds.</p>\n<p>a reed. 21:15; Isa 28:17; Eze 40:3-5; 42:15-20; Zec 2:1,2; Ga 6:14-16 and the. 10:1-5 Rise. Nu 33:18; Eze 40:1-48:35; 1Co 3:16,17; 2Co 6:16; Eph 2:20-22 1Pe 2:5,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-2","title":"Revelation 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the court. Eze 40:17-20; 42:20 leave out. Gr. cast out. it is. 13:1-18:24; Ps 79:1; La 1:10; Lu 21:24; 2Th 2:3-12; 1Ti 4:1-3 2Ti 3:1-6 and the. 21:2; 22:19; Isa 48:2; 52:1; Mt 4:5; 27:53 tread. Da 7:19; 8:10,24,25; Mt 5:13; Heb 10:29 forty. 3,11; 12:6; 13:5; Nu 14:34; Da 7:25; 12:7,11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-3","title":"Revelation 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>I will give power, etc. or, I will give unto my twowitnesses, that they may prophesy. Joh 3:27; 1Co 12:28; Eph 4:11 two. Nu 11:26; De 17:6; 19:15; Mt 18:16; 2Co 13:1 witnesses. 20:4; Lu 24:48; Joh 15:27; Ac 1:8; 2:32; 3:15; 13:31 they shall. 19:10 a thousand. 2; 12:6 clothed. Ge 37:34; 1Ch 21:16; Es 4:1,2; Job 16:15; Isa 22:12; La 2:10 Joh 3:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-4","title":"Revelation 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>two olive. Ps 52:8; Jer 11:16; Zec 4:2,3,11-14; Ro 11:17 two candlesticks. 1:20; Mt 5:14-16; Lu 11:33 standing. De 10:8; 1Ki 17:1 the God. Ex 8:22; Isa 54:5; Mic 4:13; Zec 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-5","title":"Revelation 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>fire. Nu 16:28-35; 2Ki 1:10-12; Ps 18:8; Isa 11:4; Jer 1:10; 5:14 Eze 43:3; Ho 6:5; Zec 1:6; 2:8; Ac 9:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-6","title":"Revelation 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>power. 1Ki 17:1; Lu 4:25; Jas 5:16-18 have power over. Eze 7:1-12:28,14; Ps 105:26-36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-7","title":"Revelation 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>when. 3; Lu 13:32; Joh 17:4; 19:30; Ac 20:24; 2Ti 4:7 the beast. 13:1,7,11; 17:6-8; 19:19,20; Da 7:21,22,25; 8:23,24; Zec 14:2-21 2Th 2:8,9 out. 9:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-8","title":"Revelation 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>their dead. 9; Ps 79:2,3; Jer 26:23; Eze 37:11 the great. 13; 14:8; 16:19; 17:1,5; 18:2,10,18,21 Sodom. Ge 13:13; 19:24; Isa 1:10; Jer 23:14; Eze 16:53-55; Am 4:11 Mt 10:15; 2Pe 2:6; Jude 1:7 Egypt. Ex 1:13,14; 3:7; 20:2; Ps 78:43-51 our Lord. 18:24; Lu 13:33,34; Ac 9:4; Heb 6:6; 13:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-9","title":"Revelation 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the people. 10:11; 13:7; 17:15 three. 2,3,11 and shall not. 5:8; 19:17,18; Ps 79:2,3; Ec 6:3; Isa 33:1; Jer 7:33; Mt 7:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-11-10","title":"Revelation 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>dwell. 12:13; 13:8,14; Mt 10:22 rejoice. Jud 16:23,24; Ps 13:4; 35:19,24-26; 89:42; Pr 24:17; Jer 50:11 